<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech share results delayed by technical problem.</title>
<headline>Czech share results delayed by technical problem.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wednesday morning's price fixing on the Prague Stock Exchange (PSE) has been delayed by continuing communications problems at the bourse, a spokesman said.</p>
<p>No indication was given by the PSE as to how long it would take to repair the problem.</p>
<p>-- Robin Shepherd, Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
